do_6 = "Run the four focused CI test modules together, including both existing Go helper consumers, launchpad's existing package and command checks, all four expected-runner cases, hosted and routed classifications, the real repository routing check and the container-runtime regressions; each runner assertion must enforce one exact job-specific value, never accept a choice of routed or hosted values, and preserve every existing test and assertion."
